WEBVTT

00:03.010 --> 00:08.770
Yes, the preparations to counterattack Rikai have all been completed.

00:08.770 --> 00:12.030
All that is left is to acquire the last jewel.

00:13.800 --> 00:19.000
Yes, our God, Geizer, lord of all.

00:23.270 --> 00:26.500
All that remains is... the Jewel of Hope.

02:11.500 --> 02:13.210
Damn it!

02:13.210 --> 02:14.500
Let me...

02:14.500 --> 02:18.000
go to school!

02:22.800 --> 02:24.910
Only three days left until my birthday.

02:25.410 --> 02:29.010
I need to find the last jewel before then.

02:29.010 --> 02:29.870
But...

02:38.200 --> 02:43.890
Oji-sama, what kind of power will I acquire, once I collect the final jewel?

02:44.490 --> 02:47.480
I'm feeling a little uneasy.

02:59.030 --> 02:59.900
Elis!

03:01.090 --> 03:02.770
What's wrong? Elis!

03:03.280 --> 03:06.660
The place looks like a round fluorescent light...

03:06.660 --> 03:07.120
Huh?

03:07.120 --> 03:09.490
It's really far away.

03:10.050 --> 03:12.170
The final light is there...

03:14.090 --> 03:15.510
The light...

03:15.510 --> 03:17.540
is calling to me.

03:27.140 --> 03:30.840
Elis-chan, is your body really okay?

03:30.840 --> 03:35.630
Yes, but the only image I got was too vague.

03:35.630 --> 03:39.190
It's frustrating that it didn't help locate the jewel.

03:39.190 --> 03:41.400
Don't rush it.

03:41.400 --> 03:43.490
At least we have a lead now, which will help a lot.

03:44.980 --> 03:45.700
Yes.

03:50.410 --> 03:52.500
But still, what a refreshing morning!

03:53.720 --> 03:55.210
Hiiragi, you're in quite a good mood, aren't you.

03:55.760 --> 03:59.880
Being able to have a peaceful morning walk to school is my greatest happiness!

03:59.880 --> 04:05.140
That's right, any more absences and you won't be able to graduate, right?

04:06.510 --> 04:08.280
Ah, he 'fell' back.

04:08.280 --> 04:09.060
Don't say it.

04:09.060 --> 04:11.220
Speaking of which, what were your exam results?

04:13.070 --> 04:15.980
You're going to be all right, Hiiragi-senpai!

04:20.500 --> 04:22.610
Good morning, everyone.

04:23.570 --> 04:28.030
Please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

04:24.830 --> 04:26.450
You're ignoring me?!

04:28.430 --> 04:29.790
Ah, umm...

04:29.790 --> 04:31.190
It's a 'No', 'NO'!

04:31.190 --> 04:32.310
Give it to some other group!

04:32.310 --> 04:35.590
Your answer is not among the available choices.

04:35.590 --> 04:36.420
Hiiragi-san.

04:37.560 --> 04:39.540
Ah!! Damn it!

04:39.540 --> 04:41.670
We only need to go there, right?!

04:47.000 --> 04:49.970
Today's tea is, Peppermint Tea.

04:50.360 --> 04:51.490
A wonderful aroma.

04:51.490 --> 04:54.220
Somehow, it really refreshes you, doesn't it...?

04:54.220 --> 04:56.680
Okay, okay, enough with the remarks about tea.

04:56.680 --> 04:58.210
Just hurry up and get to the assignment.

04:58.210 --> 05:00.750
You needn't be so hasty, Hiiragi-san.

05:00.750 --> 05:02.780
Some of the members haven't arrived yet.

05:02.780 --> 05:05.520
Members? Who else is there?

05:06.250 --> 05:07.990
It looks like I'm late.

05:09.010 --> 05:09.950
You guys!

05:09.950 --> 05:11.390
Dream...

05:11.390 --> 05:14.580
Everyone, thank you for helping me out the other day.

05:14.580 --> 05:18.210
Ah, my name is Shiho Elis.

05:18.210 --> 05:22.000
Ah, you must be the one with the bracelet that everyone's been talking about, right?

05:22.000 --> 05:24.000
I am Mayuri Bernstein.

05:24.000 --> 05:25.670
Pleased to meet you.

05:25.670 --> 05:28.400
I am sorry for not being able to greet you properly before.

05:28.400 --> 05:29.640
No, it's okay.

05:29.640 --> 05:31.210
Ah, that is...!

05:31.210 --> 05:34.980
Yes, it's the Jewel of Trust that Ando-san gave me.

05:35.640 --> 05:37.550
It's the green one.

05:37.550 --> 05:40.770
I'm glad it got to you safely!

05:42.030 --> 05:44.400
Looks like the Jewel of Temperance is also safely with you.

05:44.400 --> 05:48.240
Nightmare-san, thank you for your help before.

05:48.240 --> 05:51.490
It's all thanks to everyone that I was able to collect these jewels.

05:54.830 --> 05:57.160
Now then, let's discuss your assignment.

05:57.160 --> 06:01.340
It is about the location of the final jewel, the Jewel of Hope.

06:02.280 --> 06:04.240
The Jewel of Hope is here.

06:04.880 --> 06:08.150
The sixth planet in the solar system, Saturn.

06:08.780 --> 06:12.240
The jewel is inside the rings surrounding the planet.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.060
Saturn?!

06:14.770 --> 06:16.260
Ring?!

06:16.260 --> 06:18.560
The fluorescent-light like place?!

06:21.280 --> 06:23.670
But Saturn itself is...

06:23.670 --> 06:25.940
Quite far away...

06:25.940 --> 06:29.650
It's easy to speak of the rings, but their size is...

06:29.650 --> 06:30.740
That's quite true.

06:31.550 --> 06:35.260
Saturn's diameter itself is nine times the size of the Earth.

06:35.260 --> 06:40.540
And the ring width is equal to lining up five Earths.

06:40.540 --> 06:47.330
Finding the jewel there is like finding a grain of sand in a wide desert.

06:47.900 --> 06:51.850
The only person we could rely on in the end would be Elis-san.

06:52.400 --> 06:54.680
Yes, I will definitely find it.

06:54.680 --> 06:57.270
I am counting on you, Elis-san.

06:57.270 --> 07:00.630
Once you acquire the last jewel, the Jewel of Hope,

07:01.140 --> 07:04.770
we will open the route to Rikai and attack them at once.

07:05.270 --> 07:08.490
This is a united effort with the fate of the world at stake.

07:09.850 --> 07:11.450
Finally, the decisive battle.

07:11.830 --> 07:13.310
We're going to Rikai...

07:14.010 --> 07:15.020
Don't worry.

07:16.470 --> 07:18.240
We won't lose.

07:18.240 --> 07:20.750
And, we will definitely protect this world.

07:20.750 --> 07:22.250
Akari-chan...

07:22.250 --> 07:23.250
She's right!

07:23.880 --> 07:28.920
Even though we look like this, every one of us is a Wizard who once saved the world.

07:30.420 --> 07:34.590
So, don't worry and leave the rest to us!

07:34.590 --> 07:39.220
We're going to get that jewel and, together with everyone, we'll save the world!

07:39.700 --> 07:41.530
Together with everyone...

07:44.000 --> 07:47.150
By the way, how are we going to get to Saturn anyway?

07:47.150 --> 07:49.610
You're not going to ask us to swim there are you?

07:49.610 --> 07:52.030
Are we going to use the Silverstar again?

07:52.030 --> 07:54.240
There is no need for that.

07:54.240 --> 07:57.530
If you're talking about transportation, we are nearly there.

08:20.010 --> 08:22.010
You moved the whole castle?

08:22.010 --> 08:25.350
I never thought we'd be riding on a big ship...

08:25.350 --> 08:28.940
Now then, let me outline our strategy.

08:29.610 --> 08:35.920
Once Elis-san acquires the Jewel of Hope, Kureha-san will then open up the Emissary Magical Square.

08:35.920 --> 08:40.000
Elis-san, you must then go to the center of the square and activate your Broom.

08:40.520 --> 08:43.240
The door to Rikai will surely open.

08:43.240 --> 08:43.830
Yes.

08:43.830 --> 08:44.330
Understood!

08:44.830 --> 08:49.390
Hiiragi-san and Akari-san will be supporting the two of them.

08:49.390 --> 08:50.260
Got it.

08:50.260 --> 08:50.800
Understood.

08:51.300 --> 08:53.740
I have also prepared a middle sized Broom.

08:53.740 --> 08:56.690
Please go and search for the jewel at once.

08:57.270 --> 09:03.270
Mayuri-san and Nightmare will be on lookout covering the surrounding area until the gate to Rikai becomes stabl-!

09:03.700 --> 09:06.480
A Red Moon has appeared behind our fleet!

09:06.480 --> 09:07.650
What did you say?!

09:14.330 --> 09:16.230
Emulator reaction confirmed!

09:16.230 --> 09:17.280
It's increasing!

09:17.280 --> 09:18.370
The number is massive!

09:18.370 --> 09:22.010
Devil level reaction: five, six- no, there are more!

09:22.010 --> 09:22.620
This is?!

09:23.050 --> 09:26.300
A powerful Devil reaction is being emitted from the center of the enemy fleet!

09:26.300 --> 09:27.540
It's off the charts!

09:28.650 --> 09:29.710
Bell Zephyr!

09:29.710 --> 09:32.340
At last, the Greater Devil herself has appeared!

09:44.990 --> 09:48.450
I won't let things go your way, Anzelotte.

09:48.450 --> 09:52.610
The final jewel will belong to me, Bell Zephyr.

09:52.610 --> 09:54.500
Because it is destined to be so.

09:54.500 --> 09:55.900
Right, Leon?

09:55.900 --> 09:59.890
Yes, that is the end I see written here.

09:59.890 --> 10:05.910
At this battle's end, the one who will gain the Jewel of Hope is, the Greater Devil Bell Zephyr.

10:06.500 --> 10:07.250
It is you.

10:08.560 --> 10:12.920
Let's enjoy our final game, Anzelotte.

10:13.490 --> 10:16.230
Everyone, the situation has changed.

10:16.230 --> 10:20.450
Nightmare will take the Wizard fleet, and set up a defensive perimeter.

10:20.450 --> 10:21.730
Understood.

10:21.730 --> 10:24.230
No Devil will get past me.

10:24.230 --> 10:25.540
Nightmare-san...

10:25.540 --> 10:28.350
Elis-kun, please find the jewel as quickly as you can.

10:29.530 --> 10:36.820
Akari-san, you will man the long range Broom, and provide front line fire support.

10:36.820 --> 10:40.860
Right now, our fleet needs all the additional power it can get.

10:41.740 --> 10:42.640
Understood.

10:42.640 --> 10:45.920
Mayuri-san, please support Akari-san.

10:45.920 --> 10:46.930
Ah, yes.

10:46.930 --> 10:48.260
Akari-chan!

10:50.990 --> 10:53.750
Don't worry, we will definitely meet again.

10:54.250 --> 10:58.470
Once the fight's over, let's enjoy some madelenes together.

11:00.640 --> 11:02.930
Yes, it's a promise!

11:09.730 --> 11:11.550
Hiiragi-san, Kureha-san.

11:11.550 --> 11:12.230
Yes!

11:12.230 --> 11:16.400
I leave Elis-san in your hands.

11:18.320 --> 11:19.730
Leave it to us!

11:21.100 --> 11:22.910
Let's go, Elis-chan.

11:22.910 --> 11:23.660
Okay!

11:29.530 --> 11:32.000
Attention all ships, make a 180 degree turn!

11:32.770 --> 11:36.360
We will now act as the shield protecting Elis-san.

11:36.360 --> 11:40.030
We must not let a single enemy get close to Elis-san!

12:00.890 --> 12:02.360
Interesting...

12:02.780 --> 12:05.430
So, you're not even going to back up a step, huh?

12:05.430 --> 12:08.870
Listen, you all are now free to go berserk on them.

12:09.290 --> 12:13.000
If you have the chance, kill Anzelotte and bring her head to me!

12:16.250 --> 12:20.380
Oji-sama, I will definitely get my hands on the final jewel.

12:21.210 --> 12:23.510
In order to protect this world where everyone is...

12:24.010 --> 12:27.470
and in order to protect the world where you are.

12:28.010 --> 12:30.890
Bell here, Leon here, Night Wizard.

12:47.480 --> 12:53.050
Akari-san, approximately two thousand Emulators managed to avoid the bombardment and are entering Saturn!

12:53.050 --> 12:54.000
Understood.

12:59.270 --> 13:02.510
To bring down the enemy's military strength, even by a small fraction...

13:15.460 --> 13:18.230
I will never let you get near Elis.

13:19.390 --> 13:23.400
That Anzelotte is trying her best to protect Elis-chan.

13:23.400 --> 13:26.020
But I won't let that happen.

13:26.510 --> 13:27.110
Leon.

13:27.110 --> 13:28.280
Yes.

13:28.280 --> 13:34.280
Anzelotte's fleet is destined to be destroyed by our force.

13:34.280 --> 13:37.270
Azel. Azel Eaglies...

13:37.270 --> 13:38.740
It's your turn.

13:38.740 --> 13:39.540
Understood.

13:40.020 --> 13:43.560
Return, to the eternal nothingness...

13:48.550 --> 13:49.260
What's this?!

13:49.260 --> 13:50.000
It's coming!

13:53.410 --> 13:57.230
Pao Kurl, destroy the enemy's feeble front line.

14:00.510 --> 14:05.780
Kami Yukaima, use ranged attacks on any enemy that stands in front of Pao Kurl.

14:14.000 --> 14:16.290
Pao Kurl and her army continues their charge towards the enemy.

14:16.900 --> 14:19.540
Destroying all those feeble Wizards.

14:22.500 --> 14:24.680
The 15th and 16th battalions have been annihilated!

14:24.680 --> 14:27.720
The third battalion is requesting support!

14:27.720 --> 14:31.550
Retreat the third battalion to the rear and meet up with the fourth battalion!

14:31.550 --> 14:39.020
Phorne Lucius, the enemy is moving to the rear and should meet up with its support, destroy them.

14:39.020 --> 14:39.940
What?!

14:39.940 --> 14:43.870
An enemy fleet has appeared between the third and the fourth battalions!

14:43.870 --> 14:46.170
It's attacking the third battalion!

14:46.170 --> 14:47.240
At this rate they-!

14:48.290 --> 14:50.520
How are they able to read our movements?

14:50.520 --> 14:52.710
Bring the fourth battalion forward.

14:52.710 --> 14:56.300
But then the defense around this ship will be too thin!

14:56.300 --> 14:57.710
I don't care.

14:57.710 --> 14:59.750
Nightmare is in the fourth battalion.

15:00.270 --> 15:01.710
Let's bet on him.

15:02.270 --> 15:07.170
We must hold this line until Elis-san acquires the jewel at any cost!

15:15.500 --> 15:17.410
Elis, any response from the jewel?

15:17.410 --> 15:20.150
I can feel its presence, but it is still far away.

15:20.150 --> 15:23.060
We're counting on you! Your ability to sense it is the only way we can find it, after all.

15:23.290 --> 15:24.150
Yes.

15:24.670 --> 15:27.900
My light, please, answer me.

15:31.360 --> 15:34.500
Aren't we overpowering them?

15:34.500 --> 15:40.010
Yes, our fleet is advancing just as it was written in this book.

15:40.010 --> 15:41.080
I see.

15:41.080 --> 15:44.420
Well, I think it's about time for me to head out as well.

15:48.430 --> 15:49.480
Mayuri, bullets.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.550
Y-Yes!

16:00.340 --> 16:02.230
The Greater Devil, Bell Zephyr?!

16:04.520 --> 16:05.460
What's that?!

16:05.460 --> 16:06.690
A high speed enemy vessel?!

16:06.690 --> 16:08.570
No, it's a Devil!

16:15.430 --> 16:18.870
Shin, can you hear me? A powerful Devil is heading your way!

16:23.880 --> 16:24.620
You're in the way.

16:29.490 --> 16:30.650
A defensive vessel was attacked!

16:30.650 --> 16:31.490
It's sinking!

16:31.490 --> 16:35.440
It's already broken through our third defensive line, and is heading straight towards us!

16:35.440 --> 16:37.420
This is not a normal enemy.

16:37.420 --> 16:38.430
This foe is...!

16:38.430 --> 16:40.010
I know.

16:40.010 --> 16:41.890
Bell is coming, isn't she?

16:44.450 --> 16:48.460
Anjeel von Anzelotte, you are there, are you not?

16:56.530 --> 17:01.540
Anzelotte, I'll break apart that little castle of yours.

17:02.500 --> 17:03.650
Divine Corona!

17:13.920 --> 17:15.170
God damn!

17:15.510 --> 17:18.220
I'll play with you later.

17:18.220 --> 17:20.600
Until then, be mortified with yourself.

17:22.570 --> 17:25.300
Bell Zephyr has broken through the defensive line!

17:25.300 --> 17:25.850
Elis!

17:28.900 --> 17:32.280
Where are you? Answer me, my light!

17:39.240 --> 17:40.290
Elis-chan??

17:40.290 --> 17:41.560
I've found it.

17:41.560 --> 17:44.480
It's inside that huge block of ice in front of us.

17:45.240 --> 17:47.020
Good job, Elis!

17:47.020 --> 17:50.960
Light, my light, my final-

17:51.610 --> 17:52.470
What?!

17:56.000 --> 17:57.240
Bell Zephyr?!

17:58.060 --> 18:01.010
As in "the Greater Devil Bell Zephyr"?!

18:01.390 --> 18:02.830
Game over.

18:02.830 --> 18:04.040
Hiiragi Renji.

18:04.040 --> 18:09.060
Now why don't you die with your little friends and join Saturn's rings spinning forever?

18:09.860 --> 18:11.520
Your gag ain't funny!

18:11.520 --> 18:14.800
So that girl over there is Elis-chan, huh?

18:14.800 --> 18:17.230
Nice to meet you, Elis-chan.

18:18.450 --> 18:20.030
The Jewel of Hope?!

18:20.990 --> 18:26.200
Too bad, but this was destined to be mine right from the very beginning.

18:26.740 --> 18:32.000
Yes, this outcome is also just as it was written in this book.

18:32.400 --> 18:34.000
Distortion Crest!

18:34.300 --> 18:35.760
Rainbow Field!

18:41.730 --> 18:43.390
Hand over the Jewel of Hope!

18:44.360 --> 18:46.760
Take it, if you can.

18:51.000 --> 18:52.100
Gunner's Broom.

18:53.490 --> 18:54.530
Akari-san?!

18:58.520 --> 19:01.320
Hiiragi Renji, don't get hit.

19:03.620 --> 19:04.160
No way!

19:07.260 --> 19:08.720
You're too naive.

19:12.670 --> 19:15.720
Did you think a shot like that would work against me?!

19:21.000 --> 19:22.130
Imposs... ible...!

19:26.010 --> 19:26.930
Elis!

19:29.950 --> 19:32.330
Return to me, my light!

19:36.410 --> 19:37.280
We did it!

19:37.280 --> 19:38.110
Elis-chan!

19:38.110 --> 19:40.110
What is the meaning of this?! Leon!

19:40.110 --> 19:46.780
T-This can't be... It said that the Greater Devil Bell would gain the Jewel of Hope, I'm sure!

19:47.180 --> 19:51.750
There's nothing written in here about Shiho Elis getting it!

19:56.060 --> 19:59.530
Shiho Elis has secured the Jewel of Hope!

20:01.190 --> 20:03.180
You've really done well this time, Elis-san!

20:03.610 --> 20:07.010
Relay the message to Kureha-san. Open the door to Rikai as quickly as possible!

20:31.500 --> 20:33.790
My light...

20:42.600 --> 20:46.250
We've lost our defensive vessels Mito, Chuha, Jinroh, and Fuyama!

20:46.250 --> 20:48.140
The enemy's Devil fleet has also been hit.

20:48.140 --> 20:50.450
What's happening?!

20:50.450 --> 20:52.350
We are detecting a massive magical reaction!

20:52.350 --> 20:55.450
The source is... it's Shiho Elis!

20:55.450 --> 20:56.520
What did you say?!

21:02.760 --> 21:03.650
Elis-chan...

21:03.650 --> 21:04.990
Elis!

21:12.550 --> 21:16.580
Destroy everything, my light.

21:17.530 --> 21:19.090
Elis!!

21:19.090 --> 21:20.040
No, Hiiragi!

21:23.970 --> 21:25.510
Hiiragi!

21:33.570 --> 21:34.360
The moon!

21:34.360 --> 21:35.730
The satellite, Pandora.

21:40.000 --> 21:41.960
Elis, you...

21:55.580 --> 21:58.890
Hiiragi... senpai...

22:08.020 --> 22:13.000
Leon, is what's occurring right now written in your book?

22:15.520 --> 22:20.280
Could it be that I've just... unwittingly opened Pandora's Box?

22:21.750 --> 22:22.940
Elis-san...

22:25.770 --> 22:27.160
Syaimaar...

22:27.810 --> 22:29.510
The one who will bring everything to nothingness.

22:29.510 --> 22:31.360
The legendary God of Destruction.

22:32.820 --> 22:34.440
Hiiragi-senpai.

22:34.440 --> 22:36.770
What just happened?

22:37.760 --> 22:38.580
Elis...

22:38.580 --> 22:41.400
Just what have I...?

22:44.990 --> 22:49.950
It can't be... It can't be... I... I have...?

22:50.630 --> 22:53.510
Please tell me, Hiiragi-senpai!

23:04.510 --> 23:07.940
Elis, there is no need to be afraid.

23:08.370 --> 23:12.910
Your seven lights are the true light of hope.

24:51.000 --> 24:54.540
Elis' only real friends in this world are you and me.

24:55.220 --> 24:58.010
This is getting interesting, don't you think, Hiiragi Renji?

24:58.460 --> 25:03.780
Next on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, The God of Destruction, The Plank of Calneadys.
